{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04075","headline":"奉和圣制答张说出雀鼠谷 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制答张说出雀鼠谷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨施巡方罢，云从训俗廻。\n密途汾水衞，清跸晋郊陪。\n寒着山边尽，春当日下来。\n御祠玄鸟应，仙仗绿杨开。\n作颂音传雅，观文色动台。\n更知西向乐，宸藻协盐梅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04075.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04075","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}